{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2149","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Hidden Knowledge of the Ancients"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the world of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Deepwoken"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", there exists an ancient artifact — "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Tablet of Infinite Knowledge"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", on which a sequence of $$$n$$$ mysterious symbols (each symbol is an integer) is engraved."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is said that the true power of the artifact can only be revealed by finding all "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"sacred fragments"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" — continuous segments of the tablet that contain exactly $$$k$$$ distinct numbers, and their length must be between $$$l$$$ and $$$r$$$ (inclusive)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Formally: Given a sequence $$$a$$$ of length $$$n$$$ and integers $$$k$$$, $$$l$$$, $$$r$$$. You need to find the number of such boundaries $$$b$$$ and $$$c$$$ such that: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$1 \\le b \\le c \\le n$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" among the elements [$$$a_{b}, a_{b + 1}, \\dots, a_{c}$$$] there are exactly $$$k$$$ distinct numbers; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$l \\leq c - b + 1 \\leq r$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test consists of several test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following describes the test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains four integers: $$$n$$$, $$$k$$$, $$$l$$$, and $$$r$$$ $$$( 1 \\le k \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5, 1 \\le l \\le r \\le n)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ numbers $$$a_i$$$ $$$(1 \\le a_i \\le 10^9)$$$ — the mysterious symbols."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the total value of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test, output a single integer on a separate line — the number of continuous subarrays that meet the specified conditions."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n1 1 1 1\n5\n5 2 2 3\n1 2 1 3 2\n6 3 1 6\n1 2 3 1 2 3\n4 1 1 2\n7 7 7 7\n7 3 2 4\n1 2 1 2 3 2 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n5\n10\n7\n5\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case $$$a=[5]$$$, there is only one subarray $$$[5]$$$, which has a length of 1 and contains exactly $$$1$$$ distinct number."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the fourth test case $$$a=[7,7,7,7]$$$, any subarray of identical numbers gives exactly $$$1$$$ distinct number. The start and end of possible subarrays are: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Length $$$1$$$: $$$[1,1]$$$, $$$[2,2]$$$, $$$[3,3]$$$, $$$[4,4]$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Length $$$2$$$: $$$[1,2]$$$, $$$[2,3]$$$, $$$[3,4]$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"kind":"text","text":" In total: $$$7$$$."},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the fifth test case $$$a=[1,2,1,2,3,2,1]$$$: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Length $$$2$$$: all subarrays have only $$$2$$$ distinct numbers. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Length $$$3$$$: $$$[3,5]$$$, $$$[5,7]$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Length $$$4$$$: $$$[2,5]$$$, $$$[3,6]$$$, $$$[4,7]$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"kind":"text","text":" In total: $$$5$$$."}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"2149E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2149/problem/E"}